meta {
  name: Send Invitation
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trips/{{tripId}}/invitations
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "invitee_email": "friend@example.com",
    "role": "editor",
    "message": "Join me on this amazing trip to Paris!"
  }
}

docs {
  # Send Trip Invitation

  Invite someone to collaborate on a trip via email.

  **Permission Required:** Editor or higher

  **Request Body:**
  - `invitee_email` (required): Email address of the person to invite
  - `role` (required): Role to assign ("editor" or "viewer")
  - `message` (optional): Personal message to include with the invitation

  **Notes:**
  - Generates a secure random token for the invitation link
  - Invitation expires after 7 days
  - Email can be for existing or non-existing users
  - Creates an activity log entry
  - Inviter information is tracked
}
